  "notes": [
    "**Casarse** is the reflexive form of **casar** (to marry someone - perform ceremony)",
    "Regular **-AR verb** with reflexive pronouns",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Used with \"con\" to indicate who you marry: *casarse con alguien* (to marry someone)",
    "Non-reflexive **casar**: to marry (as in a priest marrying a couple)",
    "Common usage: *Me casé con Juan* (I married Juan), *Nos casamos en 2020* (We got married in 2020)",
    "Related noun: **el casamiento / la boda** (wedding)"
  ],
